{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>PROPWIZ</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PropWiz is a multiplayer, hide-and-seek, prop-hunting, party-game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539580/extras/6baad9a4325e12f234ff7c81c91c3bba.avif?t=1773546943\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539580/extras_big/6baad9a4325e12f234ff7c81c91c3bba.webp?t=1773546943 width=1560 height=877 /></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>PLAYER ABILITIES</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your own abilities to outmaneuver your opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539580/extras/d75d6c27c5d5cb50e957e0ff6af89165.avif?t=1773546943\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539580/extras_big/d75d6c27c5d5cb50e957e0ff6af89165.webp?t=1773546943 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>SCORE IS EVERYTHING</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn up your Score to have a better chance of winning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539580/extras/a0cb8276e45516f23b671860946a6cb6.avif?t=1773546943\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539580/extras_big/a0cb8276e45516f23b671860946a6cb6.webp?t=1773546943 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>DISGUISED IDENTITY</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Watch where you're aiming!&quot; -- Hitting the wrong target will cost a lot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragr